<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Auto Dismantling and Auto Destroy</Major>
    <Description>Auto Dismantling and Auto Destroy

How to use:
1. Make sure you are in windowed mode with a Resolution of 1440x1050.
2. Open and place your inventory on the top right corner.
3. Open your inventory and click either Dismantle or Destroy.
4. Make sure you arranged the items you want to destroy or dismantle.
5. Press the assigned key for he macro and watch the macro click 18 times in one go.
6. Lastly, you need to press the Dismantle/Destroy button yourself to avoid accidental dismantling and destruction of important items. 

Enjoy!!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
